---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Aravind Anilraj (phi5ic)"
  description="Systems engineer and Linux contributor. Research in erasure coding, distributed consensus, and Linux kernel internals."
>
  <div class="space-y-10">
    <header class="border-b border-[#292e42] pb-3">
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">About</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-base text-[#c0caf5] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I'm <strong>Aravind Anilraj</strong> (<code>phi5ic</code>). I'm a systems engineer and Linux contributor currently building <a href="https://github.com/phi5ic/Nifsi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nifsi</a>, an open-source distributed userspace operating system layer designed for multi-node Linux environments.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Research & Interests -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#565f89] font-medium border-b border-[#292e42] pb-2">
        research &amp; interests
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm list-disc pl-5 text-[#a9b1d6]">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Storage Architecture &amp; Coding Theory:</strong> Erasure coding, MDS array codes (EVENODD, RDP, Liberation, STAR), slice-level regeneration, and write-amplification minimization.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Distributed Computing:</strong> Virtual consensus meshes, decentralized state replication, and fast fault recovery.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Operating Systems &amp; Linux:</strong> Linux kernel contributions, userspace subsystems, and systems performance engineering.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Computer Arithmetic:</strong> Hot-path SIMD optimizations, finite-field arithmetic over GF(2ᵐ), and hardware-accelerated crypto.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#565f89] font-medium border-b border-[#292e42] pb-2">
        projects
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm list-disc pl-5 text-[#a9b1d6]">
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/phi5ic/Nifsi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-white hover:text-[#7dcfff]">Nifsi</a>: A distributed userspace OS layer on Linux.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/phi5ic/StabiSense" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-white hover:text-[#7dcfff]">StabiSense</a>: Myosa 5.0 finalist project, dynamically stabilizes chipsets during manufacturing, presented in IEEE Thailand Biosensors Conference (2026).
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/phi5ic/Qgis-Simulation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-white hover:text-[#7dcfff]">Qgis-Simulation</a>: High-performance spatial analysis tool designed to identify water pipeline breaches by combining Machine Learning, Dijkstra’s Pathfinding, and Copernicus SAR Imagery. Won first place at Flowvision Hackathon under Brahma26 (ASIET).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Technical Writing:</strong> Rigorous benchmarks, architecture postmortems, and engineering deep dives.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Connect -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#565f89] font-medium border-b border-[#292e42] pb-2">
        connect
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#9aa5ce]">
        Feel free to explore my repositories or get in touch:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li>&bull; GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/phi5ic" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@phi5ic</a></li>
        <li>&bull; Email: <a href="mailto:aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com">aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>&bull; LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aravind-anilraj/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aravind Anilraj</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
